{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/870708-can-fractals-become-full-demons","id":870708,"title":"Can Fractals become full demons ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-21T15:36:04-07:00","id":870708,"title":"Can Fractals become full demons ?","content":"I was wondering if fractals can become full demons. Can they have demonic forms integrated into there bodies. Can anyone have demon forms installed into there human bodies ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-21T15:55:15-07:00","id":870721,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/870708-can-fractals-become-full-demons#post870708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was wondering if fractals can become full demons.</div> </div> </div> </div>Up to the ST. I'd say no, and they're all the better for it, personally.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can anyone have demon forms installed into there human bodies ? </div> </div> </div>Yes! It's in Flowers of Hell, under Form Gadgets, but they're not easy to come by,","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-21T16:12:12-07:00","id":870737,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eremite</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/870708-can-fractals-become-full-demons?p=870721#post870721\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Up to the ST. I'd say no, and they're all the better for it, personally.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Yes! It's in Flowers of Hell, under Form Gadgets, but they're not easy to come by,</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Interesting. I as not sure what book said humans could use demonic forms","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-21T16:15:23-07:00","id":870739,"title":"","content":"Ordinarily, I too would say no. Having said that, the STG does talk about the nephilim, and it then got me to thinking about the God-Machine's interest in Offspring, especially Fractals.. and I had an epiphany.<br /> <br /> The God-Machine never forgot about the nephilim and how destructive to the world and Its Infrastructure they could be. At the same time, it then saw the possibilities that the nephilim represented if they could be stabilized, so it spent thousands of years studying and experimenting on the demon blooded implanting their Ciphers and weakening them, but allowing them to manipulate Aether and occult physics ( through Embeds) more easily. This in turn makes me think that the God-Machine is so interested in it's &quot;grandchildren&quot;, because it has seen a future where the demon-blooded will be integral for Its projects, and is using them as the base for a new species of humanity- one far better suited for creating Occult Matrices.<br /> <br /> But as for whether or not they can be turned into demons.. probably not. However, perhaps it's possible to &quot;reformat&quot; a Fractal into one of the Nephilim through arcane genetic modification, unlocking those long lost traits again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-21T16:40:04-07:00","id":870754,"title":"","content":"Even if a fractal can't simply awaken to being a demon it could be a great antagonist in my opinion.<br /> <br /> For example, demons have been going missing. But they haven't stayed gone as they would if the machine had found them. Instead days or weeks after their disipearance the demon shows up again dead. Pieces have been torn out of each demon but never the same piece. Law officials think a new serial killer is on the lose but demons worry that it is something more.<br /> <br /> This fractal is taking parts from demons and building itself it's own body. What will happen if the fractal suceed and manages to be reborn as a demon?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T10:47:32-07:00","id":872498,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/870708-can-fractals-become-full-demons?p=870754#post870754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even if a fractal can't simply awaken to being a demon it could be a great antagonist in my opinion.<br /> <br /> For example, demons have been going missing. But they haven't stayed gone as they would if the machine had found them. Instead days or weeks after their disipearance the demon shows up again dead. Pieces have been torn out of each demon but never the same piece. Law officials think a new serial killer is on the lose but demons worry that it is something more.<br /> <br /> This fractal is taking parts from demons and building itself it's own body. What will happen if the fractal suceed and manages to be reborn as a demon?</div> </div> </div> </div>What happens to all traitors and rogue operatives eventually; <b>Reclamation. </b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T11:02:55-07:00","id":872516,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/870708-can-fractals-become-full-demons?p=872498#post872498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What happens to all traitors and rogue operatives eventually; <b>Reclamation. </b></div> </div> </div> </div>Now that is the big detail isn't it? Is it a rogue operative or is it obeying it's cipher? On one hand it's purpose as dictated by the machine may be to reveal all demons or possibly it's purpose could be to be reclaimed. If a fractal retained their 'sight' and were recycled what a weapon the machine would have? Could any demon run the risk of learning that answer?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T11:27:20-07:00","id":872541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/870708-can-fractals-become-full-demons?p=872516#post872516\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Now that is the big detail isn't it? Is it a rogue operative or is it obeying it's cipher? On one hand it's purpose as dictated by the machine may be to reveal all demons or possibly it's purpose could be to be reclaimed. If a fractal retained their 'sight' and were recycled what a weapon the machine would have? Could any demon run the risk of learning that answer?</div> </div> </div> </div>Either way, I sense the tyke will get recycled regardless. Now whether or not this can give the God-Machine the ability to grant it's angels with the Sight is uncertain, though possible. Hell, the Judges way back when in Constantinople could somehow recognize Unchained on sight, perhaps they were originally Fractals who completed their Ciphers and were reformatted by the Machine into angels?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T11:39:22-07:00","id":872556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/870708-can-fractals-become-full-demons?p=870754#post870754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This fractal is taking parts from demons and building itself it's own body. What will happen if the fractal suceed and manages to be reborn as a demon?</div> </div> </div> </div> And if it is reborn, <i>will it</i> be reborn as a Demon? And if not, then <b>what will it become?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T13:49:16-07:00","id":872622,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_cont